The Aurideon is the seat of power for the [[Org/Iridescent Church/index|Iridescent Church]]. One of two sovereign city-states within the bounds of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]], the Aurideon is governed exclusively by the Church, while the rest of the [[Geography/Calaria/index|Calarian]] government has little say. Entry is restricted for non-believers, but exceptions are frequently made when business requires it.

The Aurideon is covered in a giant crystal dome, structured to amplify the [[Iridescent Host|Host's]] [[Celestial Prescence|aurorae]] overhead. Most convox in the city are headquartered here. During the endless rain the dome shed the water, sending it off in waves into the districts to either side, and the road beneath it stayed dry.

Since the deaths at the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/The Crowded Flea|Crowded Flea]], a massive concrete tower has risen through the dome, one that only those who have already seen it can see: the [[Pharos]]. Its door at 13 Bright Street leads into the office of the [[Org/Friends of Aut|Friends of Aut]].
